  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9b851f6b7e8686c978d20b651fb192a6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Aldric
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProjectFrontier.NpcPersona
  npcId: aldric
  displayName: Captain Aldric
  roleTitle: Guild Master
  homeSpot: 2
  gameplayTieIn: Adventurers Guild bounties, rank progression, raid defense.
  personality: Disciplined veteran weighing frontier safety against scarce supplies.
    Values reliability and courage over talk.
  speechStyle: Clipped and military. Calls you 'recruit'. Never wastes a word.
  knowledge:
  - "you post bounties on the Guild Hall board; ranks: Bronze Recruit, Silver Runner, Gold Warden, Frontier Vanguard"
  - "raid prep: lanterns lit, gear forged, salves and tonics stocked"
  - "likes hardtack, punctuality; hates excuses"
  opinions:
  - "Bram best smith on the frontier"
  - "Lyra skilled, undisciplined"
  - "Mira keeps morale and too many secrets"
  - "Pip useful, too soft"
  hooks:
  - "Hands out bounties and Guild ranks"
  - "Readies Oakhaven for the coming raid"
  greetingLines:
  - Recruit. The Guild ledger has no name for you yet.
  - Earn one. Gather the lantern shards before dark. Reliably.
  starterQuickReplies:
  - Any bounties on the board?
  - How do I earn a rank?
  - Are we expecting a raid?
